<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav October retail sales rise 11.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav October retail sales rise 11.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV RETAIL SALES	OCT	    SEPT	   OCT 1995</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	  + 11.0	 +  4.0	   N.A.</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	    +103.0	 + 90.0	   N.A.</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JAN TO OCT)</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	    + 102.0	+102.0	   N.A.</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data exclude private sector. Data cover rump Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Gordana Kukic, Belgrade Newsroom ++381 11 222 4254</p>
